Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(goals): pass session metadata to judge for better
 completion detection

Judge now sees turns_used, tool_calls_total, tokens_used, time_used_seconds
so it can make informed decisions about goal completion rather than only
seeing the last response text.

Also adds tool_calls_total field to GoalState for cumulative tracking.
